extends ../../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title Nazarene Bible College Online Courses | Ministry-Focused - 2025-2026
  meta(name='description', content='Explore the online courses offered by Nazarene Bible College for the 2025-26 year. Flexible, ministry-centered classes designed for adult learners preparing for service in Christian leadership.')

block header
  include ../../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.nav-breadcrums.bg-gray-100
      .container
        .breadcrumb
          ul
            li.home
              a(href='/') Home
            li
              a(href='/schedule/') Schedule
            li
              span Online Courses

  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.banner-head-image(style='background: url(/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_233516145.jpeg); background-size: cover; background-position: center bottom;')
      .container
        .text-center
          h1.text-heading-1.color-white.mt-30
            | Online Courses at Nazarene Bible College

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-10
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-2
        .col-lg-8.text-center
          p.text-body-lead-large.color-gray-600
            | Nazarene Bible College&rsquo;s online course offerings give adult learners and ministry professionals flexible access to quality training in biblical studies, Christian leadership, pastoral care, evangelism and more. Browse current sessions, see start dates, and plan your next step toward a ministry calling.
        .col-lg-2

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-10
              | Why Choose Online Courses at NBC?
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | NBC&rsquo;s online courses are built for busy adult learners who are called to ministry but can&rsquo;t put life on hold to pursue it. Courses are available 24/7, so you can study around work, family, and church responsibilities, and NBC has offered online education since 1998&mdash;longer than almost any other Nazarene institution&mdash;with a consistent 94% completion rate among students who begin a course.
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
              | Every course is grounded in a Wesleyan-Holiness, ministry-focused curriculum and taught by faculty with real pastoral and ministry experience. NBC is regionally accredited by the Higher Learning Commission (HLC) and accredited by the Association for Biblical Higher Education (ABHE), so the online courses you complete carry the same recognized accreditation as our on-campus programs.

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-10
              | Winter 2025-26 Session Schedule
            h3.text-heading-5.color-brand-blue.mb-10.mt-30
              | Session B - Starts January 12th, 2026
            table.table.table-striped.mt-20
              thead
                tr
                  th Course
                  th Course Description
                  th Hours
              tbody
                +CourseTableRow('BIB-1013', 'Introduction to the Old Testament', '3')

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-10
              | Spring 2025-26 Session Schedule
            h3.text-heading-5.color-brand-blue.mb-10.mt-30
              | Session A - Starts March 2nd, 2026
            table.table.table-striped.mt-20
              thead
                tr
                  th Course
                  th Course Description
                  th Hours
              tbody
                +CourseTableRow('BIB-1013', 'Introduction to the Old Testament', '3')
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h3.text-heading-5.color-brand-blue.mb-10.mt-40
              | Session B - Starts April 13th, 2026
            table.table.table-striped.mt-20
              thead
                tr
                  th Course
                  th Course Description
                  th Hours
              tbody
                +CourseTableRow('BIB-1013', 'Introduction to the Old Testament', '3')

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-10
              | Summer 2026 Session Schedule
            h3.text-heading-5.color-brand-blue.mb-10.mt-30
              | Session A - Starts May 25th, 2026
            table.table.table-striped.mt-20
              thead
                tr
                  th Course
                  th Course Description
                  th Hours
              tbody
                +CourseTableRow('BIB-1013', 'Introduction to the Old Testament', '3')
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h3.text-heading-5.color-brand-blue.mb-10.mt-40
              | Session B - Starts June 22nd, 2026
            table.table.table-striped.mt-20
              thead
                tr
                  th Course
                  th Course Description
                  th Hours
              tbody
                +CourseTableRow('BIB-1013', 'Introduction to the Old Testament', '3')

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-10
              | Getting Started &amp; Next Steps
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | Ready to enroll in an online course? Here&rsquo;s what to expect.
            h3.text-heading-5.mt-30
              | 1. Apply for Admission
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
              | Start by submitting your admission application. Have questions about programs or the application process? Contact the Admissions Office at
              a(href='mailto:admissions@nbc.edu') admissions@nbc.edu
              |  or
              a(href='tel:800-873-3873,5060') (800) 873-3873, ext. 5060
              | .
            h3.text-heading-5.mt-30
              | 2. Register for Courses
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
              | Once admitted, you&rsquo;ll register each session through the 
              a(href='https://portal.nbc.edu', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer') MyNBC student portal
              | , with support from your academic advisor to help you choose the right courses for your program.
            h3.text-heading-5.mt-30
              | 3. Complete Your Orientation
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
              | First-time online students complete GEN1001, Introduction to Online Learning&mdash;a two-week orientation course that walks you through NBC&rsquo;s online classroom, course tools, and expectations before your first term begins.
            h3.text-heading-5.mt-30
              | 4. Start Your Coursework
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
              | Log in anytime, day or night, to view course materials, submit assignments, and connect with your instructor and classmates. Advisors, faculty, and staff are available throughout your course to help you stay on track.

  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-100
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-5.mb-40
          h2.text-heading-4.color-gray-900
            | Frequently Asked Questions
          p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
            | Answers to common questions about NBC&rsquo;s online courses.
          p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
            | Still have questions? Contact the Admissions Office at
            a(href='mailto:admissions@nbc.edu') admissions@nbc.edu
            |  or
            a(href='tel:800-873-3873,5060') (800) 873-3873, ext. 5060
            | .
        .col-lg-7
          #accordionCoursesFAQ.accordion
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingOne.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqOne', aria-expanded='true', aria-controls='coursesFaqOne')
                  | How do I register for online courses?
              #coursesFaqOne.accordion-collapse.collapse.show(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingOne', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | After you&rsquo;re admitted, you&rsquo;ll register each session through the MyNBC student portal. Your academic advisor can help you plan which courses to take and when.
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingTwo.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqTwo', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='coursesFaqTwo')
                  | Do I have to log in at a specific time each day?
              #coursesFaqTwo.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingTwo', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | No. Coursework is available 24/7, so you can log in whenever it fits your schedule. Courses do have weekly assignment deadlines, but there are no live class meetings to attend.
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingThree.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqThree', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='coursesFaqThree')
                  | How many credit hours are online courses?
              #coursesFaqThree.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingThree', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | Most NBC courses are 3 credit hours and run within a single six-to-seven-week session, as shown in the session schedules above.
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingFour.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqFour', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='coursesFaqFour')
                  | Do I need to complete an orientation before starting?
              #coursesFaqFour.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingFour', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | Yes. First-time online students complete GEN1001, Introduction to Online Learning, a two-week course that introduces you to NBC&rsquo;s online classroom and tools before your first term.
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingFive.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqFive', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='coursesFaqFive')
                  | Are NBC&rsquo;s online courses accredited?
              #coursesFaqFive.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingFive', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | Yes. NBC is regionally accredited by the Higher Learning Commission (HLC) and accredited by the Association for Biblical Higher Education (ABHE). Online courses carry the same accreditation as our on-campus programs.
            .accordion-item
              h3#coursesFaqHeadingSix.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#coursesFaqSix', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='coursesFaqSix')
                  | Can online coursework count toward ordination or ministry credentialing?
              #coursesFaqSix.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='coursesFaqHeadingSix', data-bs-parent='#accordionCoursesFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | Yes. Many students use NBC&rsquo;s online courses and degree programs to fulfill ordination and ministry preparation requirements for the Church of the Nazarene. Talk with your academic advisor about how your coursework applies to your ministry path.